# <type>(<scope>): <summary>   (max 72 chars, imperative, lowercase, no full stop)
# Types: feat fix docs test refactor perf build ci chore revert
# Scopes: core, sampler, pruner, storage, cli, python, examples, repo
#
# Body: what changed and WHY (wrap at ~72 chars). Delete these comment lines.
#
# Trailers (delete what does not apply):
# Refs: #
# Perf: before/after numbers (for perf commits)
# Reviewed-by:
# BREAKING CHANGE: (public API, storage schema or CLI flag change; add the migration)
#
# Checklist before committing:
#  - one logical change per commit (don't mix refactors with new features)
#  - nothing private or large staged: no .db files, no target/ (check git status)
#  - cargo fmt, cargo clippy -- -D warnings and cargo test all pass